    "Html": "<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Vitamin B12 is not made by plants or animals, but by microbes that blanket the earth. In today’s sanitized, modern world, the water supply is commonly chlorinated to kill off any bacteria. So, while we don’t get much B12 in the water anymore, we don’t get much cholera, either, which is a good thing! A regular, reliable source is critical for anyone eating a plant-based diet. </p>\n<p>What does the latest research on B12 say? This infographic is a summary of the main takeaways and my updated recommendations.</p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-112882\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/vitamin-b12-infographic.jpg\" alt=\"Vitamin B12 infographic\" width=\"770\" height=\"2242\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/vitamin-b12-infographic.jpg 770w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/vitamin-b12-infographic-768x2236.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/vitamin-b12-infographic-528x1536.jpg 528w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/vitamin-b12-infographic-703x2048.jpg 703w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/vitamin-b12-infographic-720x2096.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/10/vitamin-b12-infographic-540x1572.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px\"/></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Get this infographic as a PDF <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/s/j3w6zg5kjcf6vkgoy69i7i48zhe5i62u\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a>.</p>\n<p>For more details around these studies, get the B12 recommendations <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/products/b12-recommendations-digital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">digital download</a>, or watch the free videos on the NutritionFacts.org <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/NutritionFactsOrg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">YouTube channel</a> or on the website’s <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/vitamin-b12/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">B12 topic page</a>.</p>\n<hr/>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\">In health,</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&#34;201341983&#34;:0,&#34;335559739&#34;:0,&#34;335559740&#34;:240}\"> </span></p>\n<p><b><span data-contrast=\"none\">Michael Greger, M.D.</span></b><span data-ccp-props=\"{&#34;201341983&#34;:0,&#34;335559739&#34;:0,&#34;335559740&#34;:240}\"> </span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\">PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b><span data-contrast=\"none\">here</span></b></a><span data-contrast=\"none\"> and watch my live presentations:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&#34;201341983&#34;:0,&#34;335559739&#34;:0,&#34;335559740&#34;:240}\"> </span></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">2019: </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b><span data-contrast=\"none\">Evidence-Based Weight Loss</span></b></a><span data-ccp-props=\"{&#34;134233279&#34;:true,&#34;201341983&#34;:0,&#34;335559739&#34;:0,&#34;335559740&#34;:240}\"> </span></li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">2016: </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b><span data-contrast=\"none\">How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</span></b></a><span data-ccp-props=\"{&#34;134233279&#34;:true,&#34;201341983&#34;:0,&#34;335559739&#34;:0,&#34;335559740&#34;:240}\"> </span></li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">2015: </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b><span data-contrast=\"none\">Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</span></b></a><span data-ccp-props=\"{&#34;134233279&#34;:true,&#34;201341983&#34;:0,&#34;335559739&#34;:0,&#34;335559740&#34;:240}\"> </span></li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">2014: </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b><span data-contrast=\"none\">From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</span></b></a><span data-ccp-props=\"{&#34;134233279&#34;:true,&#34;201341983&#34;:0,&#34;335559739&#34;:0,&#34;335559740&#34;:240}\"> </span></li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">2013: </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b><span data-contrast=\"none\">More Than an Apple a Day</span></b></a><span data-ccp-props=\"{&#34;134233279&#34;:true,&#34;201341983&#34;:0,&#34;335559739&#34;:0,&#34;335559740&#34;:240}\"> </span></li>\n<li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-aria-posinset=\"10\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">2012: </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b><span data-contrast=\"none\">Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</span></b></a><span data-ccp-props=\"{&#34;134233279&#34;:true,&#34;201341983&#34;:0,&#34;335559739&#34;:0,&#34;335559740&#34;:240}\"> </span></li>\n</ul>"
